title: Internal Security
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: govt_affairs, cabinet
on-arrival: police_timer += 6; month_actions += 1
view-if: kcp_in_government = 1 and national_defence_minister_party = "KCP" and police_timer <= 0
card-image: img/kcp_police.png

= Internal Security

Thanks to our control of the National Defence Ministry we also controll the police forces and intelligence services.

- @loyalty: Improve the loyalty of the Interior Ministry forces.
- @investigate_far_right: Investigate Zephyrian meddling in our country?.
- @domestic_enemies: Investigate or ban our domestic enemies.
- @deport_hitler
- @root: Take no action for now.
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@loyalty
on-arrival: interior_police_loyalty += 0.1 ; kcp_tyrrany += 1

We improve the loyalty of the police forces. Some people notice it and call it corruption of the defence services.

Current interior police loyalty: [+ interior_police_loyalty : loyalty +]

@investigate_far_right
go-to: investigate_far_right_success if interior_police_loyalty >= 0.55; investigate_far_right_failure if interior_police_loyalty < 0.55

@investigate_far_right_success
on-arrival: investigate_far_right += 1; sa_strength -= 20; workers_vnpf -= 3; new_middle_vnpf -= 3; nazi_urgency += 1 if investigate_far_right == 2; nazi_urgency += 2 if investigate_far_right == 3; workers_vnpf -= 3 if investigate_far_right == 3; new_middle_vnpf -= 3 if investigate_far_right == 3; old_middle_vnpf -= 3 if investigate_far_right == 3; unemployed_kcp -= 3 if investigate_far_right == 3;

[? if investigate_far_right == 1 : We have begun investigating the outside forces meddling in our republic. ?]
[? if investigate_far_right == 2 : We have noticed a significant ammount of fake citizenships given out to Zephyrian citizens which always support opposition parties.. ?]
[? if investigate_far_right == 3 : We have discovered a plot of the Zephyrian goverment to destroy the republic by causing internal instability , paranoia and scheming through the sleeper agents in our country trying to rig elections. ?]
[? if investigate_far_right == 4 : We have.... discovered Zephyr put chemicals into the water to make us gay? ?]
[? if investigate_far_right > 4 : We have discovered all of the secret plots that there are to discover. ?]


@investigate_far_right_failure

Unfortunately, our investigations have failed to turn up anything. Rumors are that the targets of our investigation were tipped off by infiltrators within the police.
